xits":[{"d":"e","t":30212},{"d":"w","t":30210}],"x":38,"y":76},{"id":30212,"name":"Room #30212","desc":"This description is yet unfinished...","sector":0,"exits":[{"d":"n","t":30203},{"d":"s","t":30216},{"d":"w","t":30211}],"x":76,"y":76},{"id":30213,"name":"Room #30213","desc":"This description is yet unfinished...","sector":0,"exits":[{"d":"s","t":30219},{"d":"u","t":30214}],"x":152,"y":418},{"id":30214,"name":"Room #30214","desc":"This description is yet unfinished...","sector":0,"exits":[{"d":"d","t":30213}],"x":190,"y":418},{"id":30215,"name":"Beach along the Sea","desc":"You are currently on a well maintained gravel walkway.  To your east\nyou see the blue waters of the sea.  To the west light seems to\nalmost be absorbed into the thick green forest canopy.  Farther south\nthe trail hints at turning more inland.  This gravel trail also continues\nnorthward.","sector":2,"exits":[{"d":"n","t":30209},{"d":"s","t":30223}],"x":342,"y":76},{"id":30216,"name":"Room #30216","desc":"This description is yet unfinished...","sector":0,"exits":[{"d":"n","t":30212},{"d":"u","t":30217}],"x":76,"y":114},{"id":30217,"name":"Room #30217","desc":"This description is yet unfinished...","sector":0,"exits":[{"d":"e","t":30218},{"d":"d","t":30216}],"x":228,"y":418},{"id":30218,"name":"Room #30218","desc":"This description is yet unfinished...","sector":0,"exits":[{"d":"w","t":30217},{"d":"d","t":30227}],"x":266,"y":418},{"id":30219,"name":"Room #30219","desc":"This description is yet unfinished...","sector":0,"exits":[{"d":"n","t":30213},{"d":"d","t":30228}],"x":304,"y":418},{"id":30220,"name":"Room #30220","desc":"This description is yet unfinished...","sector":0,"exits":[{"d":"n","t":30210},{"d":"s","t":30229}],"x":0,"y":114},{"id":30221,"name":"Lagoon Beachside","desc":"You are on a very well maintained gravel path.  The trees have been trimmed\nback to allow full view of the beach to the south and the east of here.  \nHowever dense vegetation allows almost no visibility into the interior\nof this place.","sector":2,"exits":[{"d":"e","t":30222},{"d":"s","t":30234}],"x":266,"y":114},{"id":30222,"name":"Lagoon Beachside","desc":"You are on a well maintained gravel path.  In the distance to the south\nyou can see the docks.  You may follow the path to the east or west.  To\nthe east lies more clear water, in contrast to the deep green of the\nlagoon. To the west lies more deep green lagoon water.","sector":4,"exits":[{"d":"e","t":30223},{"d":"w","t":30221}],"x":304,"y":114},{"id":30223,"name":"Mouth of Lagoon","desc":"You are at the point where the sea meets the lagoon.  The water to your\nsouth is very apparently different than the lagoon water farther west.\nYou can continue on west and head farther into the lagoon, or head\nnorth up the beach on a sturdy gravel trail.","sector":2,"exits":[{"d":"n","t":30215},{"d":"w","t":30222}],"x":342,"y":114},{"id":30224,"name":"Room #30224","desc":"This description is yet unfinished...","sector":0,"exits":[{"d":"e","t":30225},{"d":"s","t":30230}],"x":38,"y":114},{"id":30225,"name":"Room #30225","desc":"This description is yet unfinished...","sector":0,"exits":[{"d":"e","t":30226},{"d":"s","t":30231},{"d":"w","t":30224}],"x":114,"y":76},{"id":30226,"name":"Room #30226","desc":"This description is yet unfinished...","sector":0,"exits":[{"d":"s","t":30232},{"d":"w","t":30225}],"x":152,"y":76},{"id":30227,"name":"Room #30227","desc":"This description is yet unfinished...","sector":0,"exits":[{"d":"e","t":30228},{"d":"u","t":30218}],"x":342,"y":418},{"id":30228,"name":"Room #30228","desc":"This description is yet unfinished...","sector":0,"exits":[{"d":"w","t":30227},{"d":"u","t":30219}],"x":380,"y":418},{"id":30229,"name":"Room #30229","desc":"This description is yet unfinished...","sector":0,"exits":[{"d":"n","t":30220},{"d":"e","t":30230},{"d":"s","t":30239}],"x":0,"y":152},{"id":30230,"name":"Room #30230","desc":"This description is yet unfinished...","sector":0,"exits":[{"d":"n","t":30224},{"d":"e","t":